# thefamilybackpack.com — 301 redirect map
# Purpose: recover traffic from the previous owner's dead URLs (old Pinterest
# pins, old backlinks) by sending each 404 to the closest live page.
# Syntax: Cloudflare Pages / Netlify. Must sit at the PUBLISHED site root.
# Rules are first-match-wins, so specific paths go ABOVE the wildcard (*) rules.
#
# NOT redirected on purpose:
#  - /honduras-with-kids/  -> being revived with original first-hand content.
#  - Old slugs that are already LIVE pages (e.g. /milwaukee-with-kids-summer/,
#    /family-bucket-list-travel-midwest/, /what-to-pack-for-a-family-road-trip/):
#    those pins already land correctly, so we leave them alone.

