/category/*                                      /                                        301
/destinations/                                   /                                        301

# ================= NOTE ON THE OFF-NICHE LONG TAIL ==========================
# ~120 old global posts (Costa Rica, Vietnam, Japan, Barbados, etc.) have NO
# relevant live page. They are deliberately left to the custom 404 page, which
# routes visitors to the hubs. Blanket-redirecting them to the homepage would
# be read by Google as soft-404s and pass no value. Once the GSC "Not found
# (404)" export shows which of them still get real clicks, we add targeted
# redirects for only those, to the closest hub.
